  "details": "A security vulnerability has been detected in aircheng-org iWebShop-5 up to 5.16. This affects the function send_message_mobile of the file controllers/simple.php. Such manipulation of the argument user_id leads to weak password recovery. The attack can be launched remotely. The exploit has been disclosed publicly and may be used. The project was informed of the problem early through an issue report but has not responded yet.",
